{"ts": 0.230787, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nFirst, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 175}
{"ts": 0.232772, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.232971, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 93}
{"ts": 0.236243, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m 1 of 3   Which command makes a variable visible to the programs the shell\r\n", "len": 86}
