{"ts": 0.289316, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m--\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule\u001b[0m \u001b[90m---------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m \u001b[93menv  task\u001b[0m \u001b[90m--\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.289342, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.289401, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 27}
{"ts": 0.289434, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "Show that a child program can see a variable you exported.\r\n\r\n  1. Set TOPIC to the word \u001b[1mshell\u001b[0m.\r\n  2. Export it.\r\n  3. Run a child with \u001b[92mbash -c\u001b[0m that prints \u001b[92m$TOPIC\u001b[0m into seen.txt.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mThis task runs in the module's own folder; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[90m shows it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m> Do the steps, then type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 341}
{"ts": 0.292113, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.292319, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.292337, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.304618, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.30472, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.304743, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\r\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.304759, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
